  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_GERMAN} "Ihre Einstellungen und Ihr Cache werden gespeichert in:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Conservando tus ajustes y caché en:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Impostazioni e cache vengono conservati in:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_PORTUGUESE} "A manter as suas definições e cache em:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Mantendo suas configurações e cache em:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_CZECH} "Nastavení a mezipaměť zůstávají zachovány v:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_SLOVAK} "Nastavenia a vyrovnávacia pamäť zostanú zachované v:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_HUNGARIAN} "A beállítások és a gyorsítótár megőrzésre kerül itt:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_POLISH} "Ustawienia i pamięć podręczna zostaną zachowane w:"
  LangString AW_KEEP_DATA ${LANG_RUSSIAN} "Настройки и кэш будут сохранены в:"
