  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_PORTUGUESE} "Eliminar também as definições, a cache e os dados guardados (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Excluir também configurações, cache e dados salvos (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_CZECH} "Také smazat nastavení, mezipaměť a uložená data (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_SLOVAK} "Tiež odstrániť nastavenia, vyrovnávaciu pamäť a uložené dáta (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_HUNGARIAN} "Beállítások, gyorsítótár és mentett adatok törlése is (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_POLISH} "Usuń również ustawienia, pamięć podręczną i zapisane dane (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_RUSSIAN} "Также удалить настройки, кэш и сохранённые данные (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_UKRAINIAN} "Також видалити налаштування, кеш і збережені дані (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_TURKISH} "Ayrıca ayarları, önbelleği ve kayıtlı verileri sil (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_THAI} "ลบการตั้งค่า แคช และข้อมูลที่บันทึกไว้ด้วย (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
  LangString AW_UNINSTALL_DELETE_DATA ${LANG_JAPANESE} "設定、キャッシュ、保存データも削除する (%APPDATA%\Achievement Watcher Next)"
